## Suggested follow-up (needs human/orchestrator decision — not filed, per "do NOT close/file" ambiguity)

File under epic `wai-fvhv`: **`wai pipeline next` exits 0 when a gate blocks advancement** — agent/scripted flows can't distinguish "advanced" from "blocked", which converts sequencing artifacts into silent gate starvation. Either exit non-zero or print a machine-detectable marker.
